SUMMARY:Feast of Agios Georgios\, Spartochori
LOCATION:Spartochori\, Meganisi\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Spartochori's church of Agios Georgios celebrates on 23 April (or Easter Monday when the 23rd falls in Lent)\, with liturgy and a procession of the icon through the whitewashed lanes above the port of Spilia\, then coffee and sweets offered outside the church. Out of season\, so it is locals only\; a good excuse for a spring day-trip from Nydri.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/meganisi/#spartochori-feast-of-agios-georgios-spartochori
